  "body_text": "Biodiversity & Conservation\nGenomic Tools for Biodiversity ConservationAs biodiversity continues to decline, conservation managers, public authorities and research organizations need reliable tools to monitor populations and support informed management decisions.LDgenX supports conservation projects with next-generation genomic technologies, providing robust data to guide biodiversity monitoring and management.\n            Applications\n        \n        Monitoring of threatened and protected species\nNational Action Plans (NAPs)\nAssessment of genetic diversity\nDetection of inbreeding\nHybridization studies\nEcological connectivity analyses\nIndividual assignment and origin tracing\nDetection and monitoring of invasive species\nReintroduction and ecological restoration programs\n\n            Related Services\n        \n                 Environmental DNA \n            \n                Population Genomics\n            \n                Bioinformatics        \n            \n                Sequencing & dPCR\n            \n            Case Studies\n        \n        Assessment of genetic diversity and population structure\n    \n        Detection of hybridization between populations and species\n    \n        Monitoring of threatened species\n\nLet’s discuss your project\n        \n        Do you wish to implement biodiversity monitoring, study a population, or develop a specific molecular tool ?\n    \n                Contact our team",
